@startuml
title E Ticketing For Bus State Diagram

[*] --> Register
Register : do / User registration form submission
Register : exit / Registration successful or failed

Register --> ValidateRegistration
ValidateRegistration : do / Validate user details
ValidateRegistration --> Login : Validation Successful
ValidateRegistration --> [*] : Validation Failed

Login : entry / To Action
Login : do / Log in to the system
Login : exit / Username and password entered

Login --> CheckTicketStatus
CheckTicketStatus : do / Display ticket status
CheckTicketStatus : exit / Back to main menu

Login --> BookAndPay
BookAndPay : do / Ticket booking and payment
BookAndPay : exit / Ticket booked successfully

BookAndPay --> AccountManagement
AccountManagement : do / Manage account details
AccountManagement : exit / Back to main menu

AccountManagement --> Logout
Logout : do / Log out the user
Logout : exit / User logged out

Register --> [*] : Registration Failed
ValidateRegistration --> [*] : Validation Failed
BookAndPay --> [*] : Payment Failed
CheckTicketStatus --> [*] : No ticket booked
AccountManagement --> [*] : Account Management failed
Login --> [*] : Invalid username or password
Logout --> [*] : User already logged out
@enduml
